Z||000000||Seanh||11-10-2001||05:40 PM||||Sorry, this is kinda stupid but I just got some pictures back finally that we took of my car the other day (before it was hit by the damn drunk driver) and we got on of it doing a descently nice burnout, not really its best, but its still kinda cool. Anyway, if anyone else has some burnout picts please post them here!<P>Heres my 3.1L 86GT auto:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image1.gif"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly - 86 GT<BR>Back to my 3.1L...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image2.gif"> ||||reg||7
