Z||000002||Seanh||11-10-2001||08:22 PM||||No, I'm keeping and repairing the car. The damage wasn't all that bad, but I will be practially replaceing all the passenger side body panels, none are left in-tact. Its needed to be repainted and since most of the panels are going to be replaced too so I'm just going to paint the whole car. I do like the silver, but I think my choice of color is going to be viper/vette yellow w/black racing strips. Yellow adds horsepower ya know!||||reg||1
